les":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":74345.442456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":74347.197461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":74347.566056,"samples":10992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":84765.01878700001,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":85252.048886,"text":"また、革命後、入居者はすべての男性申請者に開放され、最も意欲的で成功した者が成功することを可能にした。"},{"kind":"audio","t":85315.353687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85320.628583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85325.963478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85332.135441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85337.431267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85342.807232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85347.619914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":85348.03647800001,"samples":10624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91858.160094,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92344.980776,"text":"核分裂爆弾は、多くの陽子と中性子を持つ原子核を結合させるにはエネルギーが必要であるという原理に基づいています。"},{"kind":"audio","t":92413.203638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92418.278086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":92423.805679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":92429.602657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92435.15216900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92440.582153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92445.280357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92448.173786,"samples":29224,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":97449.455216,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":97841.664817,"text":"彼は削減額の具体的な数字は示さず、中国の経済出力に基づいて削減を行うと述べました。"},{"kind":"audio","t":97902.602231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97907.694919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97913.512698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97918.732974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":97924.298836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97929.67465100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97932.842496,"samples":19392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":105752.495978,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":106129.575891,"text":"どの製造品をアンティークとするかについて、普遍的な定義は存在しません。一部の税務当局は、100年以上の古さがある物品を定義しています。"},{"kind":"audio","t":106188.637271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106193.915757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":106199.284652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106204.966052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":106210.853349,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106215.844979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106221.07735600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":106224.444638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106226.362822,"samples":19256,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":113916.877707,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":114199.33244,"text":"群島や湖では、必ずしもヨットが必要というわけではありません。"},{"kind":"audio","t":114260.442371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114265.668898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114270.864535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114276.62274400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":114278.105853,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":123561.999067,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":124109.089523,"text":"したがって、このフォーマットのアスペクト比は、12で割って最も単純な整数比を求めると、3対2であると言われています。"},{"kind":"audio","t":124171.688313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124177.046828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124182.830277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":124188.235271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124193.556816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124198.827472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":124203.681064,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":131843.449252,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":132303.018197,"text":"ここは、西暦400年頃に始まり、その後も続いた贅沢の中心地であったことで知られています。"},{"kind":"audio","t":132361.807271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132366.926889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132372.207635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132377.485021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132382.832336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132386.684912,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":136085.22486,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":136319.624808,"text":"西暦1100年頃まで続きました。"},{"kind":"audio","t":136368.024808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136369.99665999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":136370.43507399998,"samples":17264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145377.109012,"text":"Cancellation policies vary but as of late March most coronavirus based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics"},{"kind":"text","t":146033.155607,"text":"キャンセルポリシーは異なりますが、3月下旬の時点で、コロナウイルスに伴うキャンセルポリシーのほとんどは、オリンピックが開催される2020年7月まで延長されていません。"},{"kind":"audio","t":146131.55812499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146136.769672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146142.155756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146147.43680199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146153.344759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146158.88850099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":146163.35198799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146166.666072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146170.306781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146173.998019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":146174.346154,"samples":7720,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154641.058577,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball"},{"kind":"text","t":155080.41623499998,"text":"2つの乾燥した粉末を混ぜ合わせ、清潔で濡れた手でそれらを丸めてボール状にしてください。"},{"kind":"audio","t":155142.679701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155147.943757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1